I step out of the office.
There is a light rain outside.
I stand by the side of the road.
Then an auto comes.
I wave my hand and stop that auto.
"Brother, will you go up to Palarivattom?" I ask him.
"Where in Palarivattom?" he asks.
"Deepa's house is near Palarivattom main junction," I say.
I think that we will easily find the house from there.
"Okay, get in," he says.
I get into the auto.
I feel that the rain will quickly get heavier.
"Let's go fast, brother," I say.
He takes the vehicle forward.
I believe that we will reach there on time.
